# Paths excluded from the generated HTML site (fnmatch patterns, relative to the
# build root). A pattern containing '/' matches the full relative path; a pattern
# without '/' matches any single path component. One pattern per line; '#' starts
# a comment. Remove a line to publish that content again.

# The repo operating contract is for agents, not the public docs site.
